  "description": {
    "text": "The 2023-2024 Asia Championship Series ran from 1 September 2023 to 31 August 2024. Players with at least 30 points got Celebratory Fanfare with the series' 2023-24 logo, except in the regions that play with English cards, Singapore, Malaysia, the Philippines and Hong Kong's English events: Celebratory Fanfare had not yet been printed in English, so they got Stellar Crown's Glass Trumpet with the same logo instead. Pikachu SVP 101 was also printed in English with the 2023-24 logo for Singapore, Malaysia, the Philippines and Hong Kong, to coincide with the season.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: Celebratory Fanfare (MEP Promo 28), release information",
        "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Celebratory_Fanfare_(MEP_Promo_28)#Release_information"
      },
      {
